{"id":5603,"date":"2020-05-02T02:57:51","date_gmt":"2020-05-02T02:57:51","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/jammindjs.net\/?p=5603"},"modified":"2020-05-02T02:57:51","modified_gmt":"2020-05-02T02:57:51","slug":"kidfitstrong-mobile-fitness-dj","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/blog\/kidfitstrong-mobile-fitness-dj\/","title":{"rendered":"KIDFITSTRONG Mobile Fitness DJ"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In March of 2020, Jammin\u2019 DJ\u2019s \u2013 Georgia has the privilege of sponsoring KIDFITSTRONG\u2019s event in Atlanta.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">KIDFITSTRONG is a massive mobile fitness event based on an initiative the organization uses to help keep America\u2019s children happy, strong, and confident in themselves. Kids as young as 3 years old are eligible to participate in the free event, and the obstacles and courses have multiple difficulty levels to allow for every child to compete at their own pace. The obstacles and challenges include calisthenics, running, wall climbs, and tunnel crawls. And while the event is largely focused on keeping kids physically fit, adults are eligible to participate as well.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Jammin\u2019 DJ\u2019s pulled out all of the stops for the event and brought out our world-famous Jammbulance to kick off the event in style. A beast of a machine, the Jammbulance is equipped with lights, speakers, gear, and games to help reinvent the way you party. And KIDFITSTRONG certainly was a party. With the Jammbulance rocking out, every kid got the opportunity to feel like Rocky Balboa as they crossed the finish line. Let\u2019s just hope they stayed away from the raw eggs.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">KIDFITSTRONG Atlanta was a gigantic success, and Jammin\u2019 DJ\u2019s was honored, not only to take part, but to help by sponsoring such a worthy and important initiative and event. We can\u2019t wait to do it again. Heck, maybe us DJ\u2019s can even convince Jammin\u2019 John Murray to participate!<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>In March of 2020, Jammin\u2019 DJ\u2019s \u2013 Georgia has the privilege of sponsoring KIDFITSTRONG\u2019s event in Atlanta. KIDFITSTRONG is a massive mobile fitness event based on an initiative the organization uses to help keep America\u2019s children happy, strong, and confident in themselves. Kids as young as 3 years old are eligible to participate in the&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[10,11,18,20],"tags":[32,78,85,86,123,128,145],"class_list":["post-5603","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-blog","category-communities","category-events","category-news","tag-giveback","tag-charity","tag-community-group","tag-community-service","tag-jammbulance","tag-kidsfitstrong","tag-mobile-fitness"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.7 (Yoast SEO v26.7) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>KIDFITSTRONG Mobile Fitness DJ - JAMMIN&#039; DJs Georgia &amp; Tennessee<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/blog\/kidfitstrong-mobile-fitness-dj\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"KIDFITSTRONG Mobile Fitness DJ\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"In March of 2020, Jammin\u2019 DJ\u2019s \u2013 Georgia has the privilege of sponsoring KIDFITSTRONG\u2019s event in Atlanta. KIDFITSTRONG is a massive mobile fitness event based on an initiative the organization uses to help keep America\u